        "detailed_description": "Step into the cursed village in Village of the Curse. As a journalist investigating its dark past, you must survive twisted creatures, uncover hidden truths, and endure the horrors that stalk every corner.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Exploration</h2><li>Explore eerie locations like the witch’s house, the church, and the haunted cemetery, each filled with secrets and dangers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terrifying Entities</h2></li><li>Survive encounters with twisted beings lurking in the shadows—each one unpredictable, relentless, and terrifying.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Lore &amp; Artifacts</h2></li><li>Collect notes, journals, and cursed relics that unravel the village’s tragic history and guide you toward the ritual.</li></ul><br>Every step will test your courage—will you uncover the truth, or become part of the curse?",
        "about_the_game": "Step into the cursed village in Village of the Curse. As a journalist investigating its dark past, you must survive twisted creatures, uncover hidden truths, and endure the horrors that stalk every corner.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Atmospheric Exploration</h2><li>Explore eerie locations like the witch’s house, the church, and the haunted cemetery, each filled with secrets and dangers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Terrifying Entities</h2></li><li>Survive encounters with twisted beings lurking in the shadows—each one unpredictable, relentless, and terrifying.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Lore &amp; Artifacts</h2></li><li>Collect notes, journals, and cursed relics that unravel the village’s tragic history and guide you toward the ritual.</li></ul><br>Every step will test your courage—will you uncover the truth, or become part of the curse?",
        "short_description": "Uncover the secrets of an abandoned cursed village. Explore haunted locations, face twisted entities, and perform the final ritual to decide your fate.",
